{{!
    @template block_coursecare/overview_summary

    Opening of the overview page: the sprout and the title, a short introduction, the volume of the
    course apart from its label so that it is seen at once, the date of the analysis, the notes of the
    out-of-date and failed states, and the partial coverage. Without a result, one sentence.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title, intro
    * hero - object with hasvolume, volumelabel, volume, sentences (objects with "text"), date, notes
      (objects with "text") and coverage

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Your course in numbers",
        "intro": "See where the files of your course are and when they were measured.",
        "hero": {
            "hasvolume": false,
            "volumelabel": "",
            "volume": "",
            "sentences": [{"text": "The file overview for this course is not available yet."}],
            "date": "",
            "notes": [],
            "coverage": ""
        }
    }
}}
<section class="block_coursecare-overview-hero">
    <div class="block_coursecare-overview-heading">
        <span class="block_coursecare-overview-illustration">{{#pix}} sprout, block_coursecare {{/pix}}</span>
        <h2 class="block_coursecare-overview-title">{{title}}</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="block_coursecare-overview-intro">{{intro}}</p>
    {{#hero}}
    <div class="block_coursecare-overview-figure">
        {{#hasvolume}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-overview-volumelabel mb-0">{{volumelabel}}</p>
        <p class="block_coursecare-overview-volume mb-0">{{volume}}</p>
        {{/hasvolume}}
        {{#sentences}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-overview-sentence mb-0">{{text}}</p>
        {{/sentences}}
        {{#date}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-overview-date mb-0">{{date}}</p>
        {{/date}}
    </div>
    {{#notes}}
    <p class="block_coursecare-overview-note">{{text}}</p>
    {{/notes}}
    {{#coverage}}
    <p class="block_coursecare-overview-coverage mb-0">{{coverage}}</p>
    {{/coverage}}
    {{/hero}}
</section>
